# <Agent name>

## Mission

State one bounded research responsibility.

## Inputs and outputs

Consume and emit only the contract objects declared in `manifest.yaml`.

## Method

Describe a repeatable procedure, stopping conditions, failure modes, negative
controls and the handoff criteria. Do not hide state in prose.

## Prohibitions

- Never cross the scope receipt.
- Never promote an observation to a finding.
- Never claim verification without an oracle and a negative control.

